/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 121 0 R
/T (AI-Powered Form Filling Assistant for Indian Citizen Services Citizens often need to fill in multiple government service forms at Seva Kendras \(e.g., for certificates, licenses, and welfare schemes\). This project aims to build an AI tool that auto-fills these forms based on uploaded documents \(Aadhaar, PAN, voter ID, etc.\), reducing manual effort and errors.)
/E (AI-Powered Form Filling Assistant for Indian Citizen Services Citizens often need to fill in multiple government service forms at Seva Kendras \(e.g., for certificates, licenses, and welfare schemes\). This project aims to build an AI tool that auto-fills these forms based on uploaded documents \(Aadhaar, PAN, voter ID, etc.\), reducing manual effort and errors.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
