/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 127 0 R
/T (Phase-I: The system employed a customized approach combining PolyGlot for rapid source language detection coupled with Facebook's nllb-200-distilled-600M model for translation, facilitating conversion to an English-centric text space post-OCR and translated information generation for direct multilingual form-filling post-ASR, while maintaining computational efficiency. PolyGlot identifies single or multiple source languages from noisy mixed-language inputs, with detected language information forwarded alongside the source text and target language specification to the NLLB model for translation execution. The distilled NLLB-200 variant significantly reduced computational overhead and eased the dataset limitations in this domain, making it suitable for frequent fallback operations within the IVAN processing pipeline. )
/E (Phase-I: The system employed a customized approach combining PolyGlot for rapid source language detection coupled with Facebook's nllb-200-distilled-600M model for translation, facilitating conversion to an English-centric text space post-OCR and translated information generation for direct multilingual form-filling post-ASR, while maintaining computational efficiency. PolyGlot identifies single or multiple source languages from noisy mixed-language inputs, with detected language information forwarded alongside the source text and target language specification to the NLLB model for translation execution. The distilled NLLB-200 variant significantly reduced computational overhead and eased the dataset limitations in this domain, making it suitable for frequent fallback operations within the IVAN processing pipeline. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
