/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 814 0 R
/T (The pipeline testing was done on the improvements made in Phase-II of the project, with IVAN-AI \(Hybrid DR OCR\), IVAN-Translator \(PolyGlot + NLLB\), IVAN-ASR \(OpenAI Whisper\) and IVAN-NER \(BERT-Doc-NER-Max\))
/E (The pipeline testing was done on the improvements made in Phase-II of the project, with IVAN-AI \(Hybrid DR OCR\), IVAN-Translator \(PolyGlot + NLLB\), IVAN-ASR \(OpenAI Whisper\) and IVAN-NER \(BERT-Doc-NER-Max\))
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
437 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 815 0 R
/T (Though integration of IVAN-AI with GovAI-Sub web app was not possible due to localized GPU unavailability, but the IVAN AI module and GovAI-Sub module were tested individually, mimicking a real world deployment scenario.)
/E (Though integration of IVAN-AI with GovAI-Sub web app was not possible due to localized GPU unavailability, but the IVAN AI module and GovAI-Sub module were tested individually, mimicking a real world deployment scenario.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
438 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 816 0 R
/T (Pipeline efficiency is degraded by multiple factors including ASR noise sensitivity and transcription errors, outdated PolyGlot library, inadequate training of nllb-200-distilled-600M model resulting in failures on numeric strings and low-resource languages, OCR errors from highly degraded images and most critically, insufficient training data for the NER module \(limited set of manually annotated 100 samples\), considering legal constraints of replicating government data.)
/E (Pipeline efficiency is degraded by multiple factors including ASR noise sensitivity and transcription errors, outdated PolyGlot library, inadequate training of nllb-200-distilled-600M model resulting in failures on numeric strings and low-resource languages, OCR errors from highly degraded images and most critically, insufficient training data for the NER module \(limited set of manually annotated 100 samples\), considering legal constraints of replicating government data.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
439 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 136 0 R
/T (Conclusion: Despite these challenges, the IVAN-AI and GovAI-Sub system provides a robust, end-to-end, modular pipeline integrated successfully for automating Indic form-filing tasks with considerable benchmarks and novelties for being developed on such a complex, resource-constrained NLP domain. It counters significant research gaps, with high enhancement potential.)
/E (Conclusion: Despite these challenges, the IVAN-AI and GovAI-Sub system provides a robust, end-to-end, modular pipeline integrated successfully for automating Indic form-filing tasks with considerable benchmarks and novelties for being developed on such a complex, resource-constrained NLP domain. It counters significant research gaps, with high enhancement potential.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
